Changes from rea-video:
- src/track.rs and src/shots.rs are a Rust port of rea_video/shots.py. The
  optical-flow check that rejects motion posing as a dissolve uses block
  matching on the thumbnails in place of OpenCV Farneback flow.
- src/media.rs is a Rust port of the ffprobe and frame-pipe parts of
  rea_video/media.py.
- src/probe.rs is a Rust port of rea_video/probe.py with English output,
  global platform signatures (YouTube, TikTok, Instagram and others), more
  desktop editors, renderers, screen recorders and generators, an encoder
  tool category, and TikTok AIGC labels.
